{"Missing TopicUser crashes unsubscribe - TopicUser.find_by can return nil for a logged-in user visiting an unsubscribe URL for a public topic they have not tracked, and notification_level may also be nil, causing tu.notification_level > ... to raise an error instead of handling the unsubscribe": 0.9802647829055786, "GET request mutates notifications - the unsubscribe route exposes topics#unsubscribe as a plain GET while the action changes TopicUser.notification_level, allowing cross-site requests to silently downgrade or mute topic notifications without CSRF protection": 0.968279242515564, "Route template names diverge - the top-level topicUnsubscribe route doesn't match the template at templates/topic/unsubscribe.hbs which expects a nested topic.unsubscribe route, causing Ember to potentially miss the intended template": 0.9194276928901672, "Shared translation requires new key - the shared unsubscribe_link text now always interpolates %{unsubscribe_url}, but existing callers or plugins using Email::MessageBuilder with add_unsubscribe_link: true and no topic URL will raise during email rendering": 0.8614552021026611}